### 所有请求均通过网关 9001 端口转发
### 登录后将返回的 token 填入下方变量

@gateway = http://localhost:9001
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIyMDM0NTg1NTU1MjA3NjgwMDAxIiwiaWF0IjoxNzc0MjMwODgyLCJleHAiOjE3NzQzMTcyODJ9.vfJT_PZQ_YzKozdms9SlH19ZsOiDj8l0k4C_bMJohGq98LKfmJaUPgYjqykwRD9R

### =========================================================
###  1. 用户认证与基础信息
### =========================================================

### 1.1 注册用户
POST {{gateway}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 1.2 登录（成功后复制返回的 token 填入上方 @token）
POST {{gateway}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 1.3 登录失败 - 密码错误
POST {{gateway}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "wrong_password"
}

### 1.4 无 token 访问（应返回 401）
GET {{gateway}}/doctor/search/online

### 1.5 新增就诊人
POST {{gateway}}/user/patient/insert
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "张三",
  "idCard": "110101199001011234",
  "gender": 1,
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
  "phone": "13900000001"
}

### 1.6 查询当前用户的就诊人列表
GET {{gateway}}/user/patient/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =========================================================
###  2. 基础数据准备 (医生、排班规则与生成)
### =========================================================

### 2.1 查询在线医生列表
GET {{gateway}}/doctor/search/online
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.2 更新医生挂号费
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/update/fee?doctorId=11&fee=160.00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---- 批量新增医生 ----
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/insert
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "id": 1, "deptId": 10, "name": "李明", "title": "主任医师", "fee": 200.00, "status": 1 }
###
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/insert
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "id": 2, "deptId": 11, "name": "王芳", "title": "副主任医师", "fee": 150.00, "status": 1 }
###
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/insert
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "id": 3, "deptId": 12, "name": "张伟", "title": "主治医师", "fee": 100.00, "status": 1 }

### ---- 批量设置排班规则 ----
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/insert/schedule/rule
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"docId": 1, "dayOfWeek": 1, "maxCount": 30}
###
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/insert/schedule/rule
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"docId": 1, "dayOfWeek": 3, "maxCount": 25}
###
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/insert/schedule/rule
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"docId": 2, "dayOfWeek": 2, "maxCount": 30}
###
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/insert/schedule/rule
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"docId": 3, "dayOfWeek": 1, "maxCount": 20}

### ---- 批量生成未来4周排班 ----
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/insert/schedule?docId=1&weeks=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/insert/schedule?docId=2&weeks=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/insert/schedule?docId=3&weeks=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =========================================================
###  3. 核心业务流程 (查号 -> 挂号 -> 支付)
### =========================================================

### 3.1 获取目标病人 ID (填入下方 patientId)
GET {{gateway}}/user/patient/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.2 查询某日所有排班号源 (Redis 缓存架构，填入下方 scheduleId)
GET {{gateway}}/doctor/schedule/detail?workDate=2026-03-26
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.3 查看某个具体排班的实时库存和详情
GET {{gateway}}/doctor/schedule/detail/id?scheduleId=2740830766718144079
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.4 为某个排班放号 (补充库存)
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/schedule/release?scheduleId=2740830766718144079&num=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.5 [高并发架构] 创建挂号订单 (Redis 预扣 + MQ 异步落库)
POST {{gateway}}/order/create?patientId=4935213193722298120&scheduleId=2740830766718144079
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.6 查询当前用户订单列表 (确认是否出单成功，填入下方 orderId)
GET {{gateway}}/order/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.7 查看具体订单详情
GET {{gateway}}/order/detail?orderId=3519788135548253944
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.8 对订单发起支付
POST {{gateway}}/pay?orderId=3519788135548253944
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.9 重复支付测试（应失败，status 已不为 0）
POST {{gateway}}/pay?orderId=3519788135548253944
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =========================================================
###  4. 压力测试对照组 (Baseline：纯 DB 同步架构)
### =========================================================

### 4.1 [Baseline] 纯 DB 多表联查当日排班列表
GET {{gateway}}/doctor/schedule/detail/db?workDate=2026-03-26
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4.2 [Baseline] 纯 DB 行锁同步扣减与下单
POST {{gateway}}/order/create/db?patientId=4935213193722298120&scheduleId=2740830766718144079
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
